From: Dev <dev@example.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 03:50:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Ghast and fireball 3/3: interpolated charge, fireball
 billboard, docs

ghast_squash interpolates the charge counter between prev_charge and
charge by the frame's partial tick (push_mob takes the partial), as
RenderGhast does. The fireball is now the snowball sprite on a quad
2 blocks across turned square to the eye (RenderFireball) instead of a
cube. README's M8 row no longer says "no ghast"; changelog entry 32
updated. tools/gen_terrain.py was run in a scratch copy and reproduces
the art.rgba of 2/3 byte for byte.

Not compiled: no Rust toolchain was available.
